      "text": "National data protection readiness: data protection system",
      "indicator_id": "gov.protect--national-data-protection-readiness",
      "norm_short": "The African Union's Data Policy Framework (2022) asks each member state for a data protection law, an independent authority and working practice, and to ratify the Malabo Convention. It sets no measure of them.",
